      "content": "everything i worked for is just... gone. the scholarship, the internship, all of it. i feel like a complete fraud. my parents look at me like they dont even recognize me anymore. i was the one who always had it together, and now i'm just this massive disappointment. i don't think i can ever go back to being that person.",
