    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a \"setback\" though. it feels like the only thing i ever had was being that person. if i'm not the successful one, the one they can rely on, then what am i even for? i look at them and i just see this look of pure pity and shame. i feel like i've ruined everything they invested in. i'd rather they just remember me as the kid who actually made it, instead of watching me crawl through the mud for the next few years.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
